    "clinicalPearl": "Key takeaway: G6PD crisis from primaquine (Mediterranean variant most severe) → discontinue drug + supportive care. Test G6PD AFTER acute hemolysis (≥3 months) — falsely normal during acute episode. SCREEN G6PD BEFORE prescribing primaquine/tafenoquine/dapsone.",
